# CV Rewrite Recommendations

After completing the assessment, provide concrete rewrite recommendations.

The goal is not only to critique the CV but also to improve it.

Do not invent:

- Experience
- Technologies
- Responsibilities
- Results
- Certifications
- Industries
- Metrics

Use placeholders when information is missing:

- [result]
- [impact]
- [business value]
- [stakeholder]
- [time period]
- [number of users]

